### The most important feature: Collision prevention

The proposal explicitly describes a system that checks the actual physical inventory for overlapping booking dates before confirming a vehicle.&#x20;

Kigali Fleet Management SaaS Proposal.pdf



Example:

A company has one Toyota RAV4.

- Customer A books November 10–13.
- Customer B requests November 12–15.

The system must reject the overlapping allocation.

It must also protect against two customers trying to reserve the same vehicle simultaneously.

This is not merely a calendar feature. It requires backend validation and reliable database transactions.

